{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25856","headline":"却到金陵登北固亭 · 李绅","name":"却到金陵登北固亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙形江影隔云深，虎势山光入浪沈。\n潮蹙海风驱万里，日浮天堑洞千寻。\n衆峰作限横空碧，一柱中维彻底金。\n还叱檝师看五两，莫令辜负济川心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25856.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25856","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}